I suspect such lujvo will be very rare, because the tendency seems
to be to interpret them as [selxxx]xxx. In jbovlaste I found only one
each of types selkem[xxxxxx], terkem[xxxxxx], velkem[xxxxxx], and
none with xelkem-. I couldn't find any without -kem- and meant to be
interpreted as sel[xxxxxx], but there might be some and I might have
missed them. Is anyone aware of any such lujvo?

